<!-- ══════════ HOW IT WORKS ══════════ -->
<div class="section reveal" id="how">
  <div class="sec-chip" data-en="The Process" data-ar="آلية العمل">The Process</div>
  <h2 class="sec-title" data-en="From Idea in Your Head<br>to <span class='g'>Business on the Ground</span>" data-ar="من فكرة في دماغك<br>إلى <span class='g'>مشروع على أرض الواقع</span>">From Idea in Your Head<br>to <span class="g">Business on the Ground</span></h2>
  <p class="sec-body" data-en="Five precise steps from the moment someone submits their idea to the moment execution begins — all within a defined, transparent system." data-ar="خمس خطوات محددة من لحظة تقديم الفكرة حتى بدء التنفيذ — كل شيء ضمن نظام شفاف ومحدد.">Five precise steps from the moment someone submits their idea to the moment execution begins — all within a defined, transparent system.</p>

  <div class="process">
    <div class="process-track"></div>
    <div class="process-steps">
      <div class="ps">
        <span class="ps-num">STEP 01</span>
        <div class="ps-ico"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg></div>
        <h3 data-en="Submit Brief" data-ar="تقديم الفكرة">Submit Brief</h3>
        <p data-en="A simple form: idea name, industry, the problem it solves, skills needed, and any initial resources." data-ar="نموذج بسيط: اسم الفكرة، الصناعة، المشكلة التي تحلها، المهارات المطلوبة.">A simple form: idea name, industry, the problem it solves, skills needed, and any initial resources.</p>
        <span class="ps-time" data-en="5 min" data-ar="5 دقائق">5 min</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ps">
        <span class="ps-num">STEP 02</span>
        <div class="ps-ico"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="10" rx="2"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2"></circle><path d="M12 7v4"></path><line x1="8" y1="16" x2="8" y2="16"></line><line x1="16" y1="16" x2="16" y2="16"></line></svg></div>
        <h3 data-en="AI Evaluation" data-ar="تقييم الذكاء الاصطناعي">AI Evaluation</h3>
        <p data-en="GPT-4 analyzes viability, market size, and feasibility. A Viability Score from 0–100 is generated instantly." data-ar="يحلل GPT-4 الجدوى وحجم السوق والقابلية للتنفيذ. يُولَّد Viability Score من 0 إلى 100 فوراً.">GPT-4 analyzes viability, market size, and feasibility. A Viability Score from 0–100 is generated instantly.</p>
        <span class="ps-time" data-en="Automatic" data-ar="تلقائي">Automatic</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ps">
        <span class="ps-num">STEP 03</span>
        <div class="ps-ico"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 data-en="Closed Meeting" data-ar="الاجتماع المغلق">Closed Meeting</h3>
        <p data-en="45-min private session with the UrLife team to understand the full vision and determine partnership terms." data-ar="جلسة خاصة 45 دقيقة مع فريق UrLife لفهم الرؤية الكاملة وتحديد شروط الشراكة.">45-min private session with the UrLife team to understand the full vision and determine partnership terms.</p>
        <span class="ps-time" data-en="45 min" data-ar="45 دقيقة">45 min</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ps">
        <span class="ps-num">STEP 04</span>
        <div class="ps-ico"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.5 6c-2.5.5-5.5.5-8 0-2.5-.5-5.5-.5-8 0-2.5.5-2.5 2-2.5 4s.5 3.5 2.5 4c2.5.5 5.5.5 8 0 2.5-.5 5.5-.5 8 0 2.5.5 2.5 2 2.5 4s-.5 3.5-2.5 4c-2.5.5-5.5.5-8 0-2.5-.5-5.5-.5-8 0-2.5.5-2.5 2-2.5 4s.5 3.5 2.5 4"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 data-en="Team Assembly" data-ar="تجميع الفريق">Team Assembly</h3>
        <p data-en="AI matches the idea with Builders and experts from the platform based on complementary skills and ambition alignment." data-ar="يطابق الذكاء الاصطناعي الفكرة مع البنّائين والخبراء من المنصة بناءً على المهارات التكميلية.">AI matches the idea with Builders and experts from the platform based on complementary skills and ambition alignment.</p>
        <span class="ps-time" data-en="48–72h" data-ar="48–72 ساعة">48–72h</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ps" style="border-color:var(--goldl);">
        <span class="ps-num">STEP 05</span>
        <div class="ps-ico" style="background:var(--goldf);"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"></path><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"></path><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 data-en="Execute & Share" data-ar="التنفيذ وتوزيع النجاح">Execute & Share</h3>
        <p data-en="The project launches inside UrLife's infrastructure. When it succeeds, equity or revenue share is distributed to all contributors." data-ar="ينطلق المشروع داخل بنية UrLife. عند النجاح، تُوزَّع الحصص على جميع المساهمين.">The project launches inside UrLife's infrastructure. When it succeeds, equity or revenue share is distributed to all contributors.</p>
        <span class="ps-time" data-en="Equity / Rev-Share" data-ar="حصة / مشاركة إيراد">Equity / Rev-Share</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="divline"></div>

<!-- ══════════ 3 ROLES ══════════ -->
<div class="section reveal" id="roles">
  <div class="sec-chip" data-en="Who It's For" data-ar="من هو لهم">Who It's For</div>
  <h2 class="sec-title" data-en="3 Types of Minds<br><span class='g'>That Complete Each Other</span>" data-ar="3 أنواع من العقول<br><span class='g'>تكمل بعضها</span>">3 Types of Minds<br><span class="g">That Complete Each Other</span></h2>
  <p class="sec-body" data-en="Every person on UrLife has something to give and something to gain. The AI matching engine ensures everyone finds exactly who completes them." data-ar="كل شخص على UrLife لديه ما يعطيه وما يكسبه. يضمن محرك المطابقة الذكي أن يجد كل شخص من يكمله بالضبط.">Every person on UrLife has something to give and something to gain. The AI matching engine ensures everyone finds exactly who completes them.</p>

  <div class="roles-grid">
    <div class="role-card rc-gold">
      <div class="rc-num">01</div>
      <span class="rc-ico"><svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path><path d="M15.09 14c.18-.9.27-1.85.26-2.83.07-1.27-.16-2.54-.67-3.71-.36-.81-.9-1.52-1.57-2.09-.63-.54-1.38-.92-2.18-1.1-.79-.19-1.61-.2-2.4-.03-.78.17-1.51.54-2.12 1.07-.66.57-1.18 1.28-1.53 2.08-.5 1.17-.72 2.44-.64 3.71-.01.98.08 1.93.26 2.83"></path><path d="M12 2v4"></path><path d="M12 18v4"></path></svg></span>
      <h3 data-en="The Visionary" data-ar="صاحب الفكرة — The Visionary">The Visionary</h3>
      <p data-en="Has a powerful business idea but needs people to build it. No technical expertise or capital required — just a clear vision and real ambition." data-ar="عنده فكرة مشروع قوية لكن يحتاج من يبنيها معه. لا يُشترط خبرة تقنية أو مال — فقط رؤية واضحة وطموح حقيقي.">Has a powerful business idea but needs people to build it. No technical expertise or capital required — just a clear vision and real ambition.</p>
      <ul class="rc-list">
        <li data-en="Submit idea and request closed meeting" data-ar="تقديم الفكرة وطلب اجتماع مغلق">Submit idea and request closed meeting</li>
        <li data-en="Get matched with co-founders & builders" data-ar="الحصول على co-founders وbuilders مناسبين">Get matched with co-founders & builders</li>
        <li data-en="Full AI support throughout execution" data-ar="دعم AI كامل طوال التنفيذ">Full AI support throughout execution</li>
        <li data-en="Retain majority equity in your venture" data-ar="الاحتفاظ بالحصة الأكبر في مشروعك">Retain majority equity in your venture</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="role-card rc-sky">
      <div class="rc-num">02</div>
      <span class="rc-ico"><svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></span>
      <h3 data-en="The Builder" data-ar="صاحب المهارة — The Builder">The Builder</h3>
      <p data-en="Has expertise — tech, design, marketing, law, finance — and wants to deploy it on a meaningful project rather than working for someone else." data-ar="عنده خبرة — تقنية، تصميم، تسويق، قانون، مالية — ويريد توظيفها في مشروع حقيقي بدل العمل لحساب غيره.">Has expertise — tech, design, marketing, law, finance — and wants to deploy it on a meaningful project rather than working for someone else.</p>
      <ul class="rc-list">
        <li data-en="Get matched to ideas that fit your skills" data-ar="مطابقة مع الأفكار التي تناسب مهاراتك">Get matched to ideas that fit your skills</li>
        <li data-en="Join as a co-founder with equity stake" data-ar="الانضمام كـ co-founder بحصة ملكية">Join as a co-founder with equity stake</li>
        <li data-en="Build a real portfolio of launched ventures" data-ar="بناء portfolio حقيقي من المشاريع المطلقة">Build a real portfolio of launched ventures</li>
        <li data-en="Grow alongside the smartest people" data-ar="التطور مع أذكى الناس">Grow alongside the smartest people</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="role-card rc-mint">
      <div class="rc-num">03</div>
      <span class="rc-ico"><svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg></span>
      <h3 data-en="The Enabler" data-ar="صاحب الإمكانية — The Enabler">The Enabler</h3>
      <p data-en="Has capital or resources but lacks ideas or time to execute. Invests in pre-vetted, AI-evaluated ideas and shares in their success." data-ar="عنده مال أو موارد لكن ليس لديه أفكار أو وقت للتنفيذ. يستثمر في أفكار مُفلتَرة ومُقيَّمة بالذكاء الاصطناعي ويشارك في نجاحها.">Has capital or resources but lacks ideas or time to execute. Invests in pre-vetted, AI-evaluated ideas and shares in their success.</p>
      <ul class="rc-list">
        <li data-en="Fund pre-screened, high-potential ideas" data-ar="تمويل أفكار عالية الإمكانية ومفلتَرة مسبقاً">Fund pre-screened, high-potential ideas</li>
        <li data-en="Receive clearly defined equity upfront" data-ar="الحصول على حصة ملكية محددة مسبقاً">Receive clearly defined equity upfront</li>
        <li data-en="Full progress transparency via dashboard" data-ar="شفافية كاملة للتقدم عبر لوحة تحكم">Full progress transparency via dashboard</li>
        <li data-en="Contribute to community-driven growth" data-ar="المساهمة في النمو القائم على المجتمع">Contribute to community-driven growth</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="divline"></div>

<!-- ══════════ CLOSED MEETING ══════════ -->
<div class="section reveal" id="meeting">
  <div class="sec-chip" data-en="The Gateway" data-ar="البوابة الحقيقية">The Gateway</div>
  <h2 class="sec-title" data-en="The Closed Meeting —<br><span class='g'>Heart of the System</span>" data-ar="الاجتماع المغلق —<br><span class='g'>قلب النظام</span>">The Closed Meeting —<br><span class="g">Heart of the System</span></h2>
  <p class="sec-body" data-en="Not just a call — this is the gateway. Here UrLife decides whether your idea is worthy of our time, resources, and partnership." data-ar="ليس مجرد مكالمة — هذه هي البوابة الحقيقية. هنا تقرر UrLife هل فكرتك تستحق وقتنا ومواردنا وشراكتنا.">Not just a call — this is the gateway. Here UrLife decides whether your idea is worthy of our time, resources, and partnership.</p>

  <div class="meeting-box reveal-scale">
    <div class="mb-top">
      <h3 data-en="How the Closed Meeting Works — Exactly" data-ar="كيف يعمل الاجتماع المغلق — بالتفصيل"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px;"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>How the Closed Meeting Works — Exactly</h3>
      <span class="restricted" data-en="INVITE ONLY" data-ar="بدعوة فقط">INVITE ONLY</span>
    </div>
    <div class="mb-flow">
      <div class="mbs">
        <div class="mbs-ico"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg></div>
        <h4 data-en="Meeting Request" data-ar="طلب الاجتماع">Meeting Request</h4>
        <p data-en="Submitted after AI Viability Score ≥60" data-ar="يُقدَّم بعد Viability Score ≥60">Submitted after AI Viability Score ≥60</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mbs">
        <div class="mbs-ico"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div>
        <h4 data-en="Pre-Meeting AI Brief" data-ar="ملخص AI قبل الاجتماع">Pre-Meeting AI Brief</h4>
        <p data-en="AI prepares a full analysis before the session" data-ar="AI يحضّر تحليلاً كاملاً قبل الجلسة">AI prepares a full analysis before the session</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mbs">
        <div class="mbs-ico"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="23"></line><line x1="8" y1="23" x2="16" y2="23"></line></svg></div>
        <h4 data-en="45-Min Session" data-ar="جلسة 45 دقيقة">45-Min Session</h4>
        <p data-en="Vision, challenges, resources, mutual expectations" data-ar="الرؤية، التحديات، الموارد، التوقعات المتبادلة">Vision, challenges, resources, mutual expectations</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mbs">
        <div class="mbs-ico"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg></div>
        <h4 data-en="Decision in 48h" data-ar="قرار في 48 ساعة">Decision in 48h</h4>
        <p data-en="UrLife: Partner, Facilitate, or Builder-only" data-ar="UrLife: شريك، مُسهّل، أو Builder فقط">UrLife: Partner, Facilitate, or Builder-only</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mbs">
        <div class="mbs-ico"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg></div>
        <h4 data-en="Partnership Terms" data-ar="شروط الشراكة">Partnership Terms</h4>
        <p data-en="Clear agreement: roles, equity, milestones" data-ar="اتفاقية واضحة: الأدوار، الحصص، المعالم">Clear agreement: roles, equity, milestones</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mb-note">
      <strong data-en="UrLife partners as:" data-ar="UrLife تشارك كـ:">UrLife partners as:</strong> <span data-en="Strategic partner (Equity) + Team builder + AI infrastructure provider — not just a platform. A genuine partnership in your venture's success." data-ar="شريك استراتيجي (Equity) + بانٍ للفريق + موفر بنية AI — ليس مجرد منصة. شراكة حقيقية في نجاح مشروعك.">Strategic partner (Equity) + Team builder + AI infrastructure provider — not just a platform. A genuine partnership in your venture's success.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="divline"></div>

<!-- ══════════ REVENUE ══════════ -->
<div class="section reveal" id="revenue">
  <div class="sec-chip" data-en="Revenue Model" data-ar="نموذج الإيراد">Revenue Model</div>
  <h2 class="sec-title" data-en="UrLife Wins<br><span class='g'>Only When You Win</span>" data-ar="UrLife تربح<br><span class='g'>فقط لما تربح أنت</span>">UrLife Wins<br><span class="g">Only When You Win</span></h2>
  <p class="sec-body" data-en="No upfront fees. No subscriptions. UrLife earns only when the projects it supports generate revenue — that's real alignment." data-ar="لا رسوم مسبقة. لا اشتراكات. UrLife تكسب فقط عندما تُولِّد المشاريع التي تدعمها إيراداً — هذا هو التوافق الحقيقي.">No upfront fees. No subscriptions. UrLife earns only when the projects it supports generate revenue — that's real alignment.</p>

  <div class="rev-grid">
    <div class="rev-card rev-main">
      <div class="rev-ico"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="7"></circle><polyline points="8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88"></polyline></svg></div>
      <h3 data-en="Equity & Revenue Share" data-ar="الحصة والمشاركة في الإيراد">Equity & Revenue Share</h3>
      <p data-en="UrLife takes a small stake in every project it partners with — agreed upon transparently from day one. When the project succeeds, everyone gets their share." data-ar="UrLife تأخذ حصة صغيرة في كل مشروع تشارك فيه — متفق عليها بشفافية من اليوم الأول. عند نجاح المشروع، يأخذ الجميع نصيبهم.">UrLife takes a small stake in every project it partners with — agreed upon transparently from day one. When the project succeeds, everyone gets their share.</p>
      <div class="rev-num">5–15%</div>
      <div class="rev-num-l" data-en="equity per project, based on contribution level" data-ar="حصة في المشروع حسب مستوى المساهمة">equity per project, based on contribution level</div>
      <ul class="rev-list">
        <li data-en="Equity = long-term strategic partnership" data-ar="Equity = شراكة استراتيجية طويلة المدى">Equity = long-term strategic partnership</li>
        <li data-en="Revenue Share = % of monthly earnings" data-ar="مشاركة الإيراد = % من الأرباح الشهرية">Revenue Share = % of monthly earnings</li>
        <li data-en="Advisory Stake = AI + network access only" data-ar="حصة استشارية = AI + وصول للشبكة فقط">Advisory Stake = AI + network access only</li>
        <li data-en="Written & signed before execution begins" data-ar="مكتوبة وموقعة قبل بدء التنفيذ">Written & signed before execution begins</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="rev-pill" data-en="Primary Revenue Source" data-ar="المصدر الرئيسي للإيراد">Primary Revenue Source</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rev-card rev-side">
      <div class="rev-ico"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></div>
      <h3 data-en="Enabler Fund Matching" data-ar="مطابقة صندوق الممكّنين">Enabler Fund Matching</h3>
      <p data-en="Enablers invest in pre-vetted ideas. UrLife takes a small matching fee per deal." data-ar="يستثمر الممكّنون في أفكار مُفلتَرة مسبقاً. UrLife تأخذ رسمًا صغيراً للمطابقة لكل صفقة.">Enablers invest in pre-vetted ideas. UrLife takes a small matching fee per deal.</p>
      <div class="rev-num">2–5%</div>
      <div class="rev-num-l" data-en="of investment size" data-ar="من حجم الاستثمار">of investment size</div>
      <span class="rev-pill" data-en="Phase 2 — Month 8+" data-ar="المرحلة 2 — الشهر 8+">Phase 2 — Month 8+</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rev-card rev-side">
      <div class="rev-ico"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="9" y1="22" x2="9" y2="22.01"></line><line x1="15" y1="22" x2="15" y2="22.01"></line><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="22.01"></line><line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="22"></line><line x1="4" y1="10" x2="20" y2="10"></line><line x1="4" y1="14" x2="20" y2="14"></line><line x1="4" y1="18" x2="20" y2="18"></line></svg></div>
      <h3 data-en="Corporate Innovation Access" data-ar="وصول الشركات للابتكار">Corporate Innovation Access</h3>
      <p data-en="Large corporations pay for early access to UrLife's top ideas and talent pool." data-ar="تدفع الشركات الكبرى للوصول المبكر إلى أفضل أفكار ومواهب UrLife.">Large corporations pay for early access to UrLife's top ideas and talent pool.</p>
      <div class="rev-num">$50K+</div>
      <div class="rev-num-l" data-en="annually per company" data-ar="سنوياً لكل شركة">annually per company</div>
      <span class="rev-pill" data-en="Phase 3 — Year 2+" data-ar="المرحلة 3 — السنة 2+">Phase 3 — Year 2+</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="inv-box reveal">
    <div>
      <h3 data-en="The Enabler Layer — Smart Capital Meets Vetted Ideas" data-ar="طبقة الممكّنين — رأس المال الذكي يلتقي بالأفكار المُفلتَرة"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px;"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path></svg>The Enabler Layer — Smart Capital Meets Vetted Ideas</h3>
      <p data-en="People with capital but without ideas — the platform gives them the opportunity to invest in AI-filtered, thoroughly assessed ventures. Not random investing — investing in ideas that have been validated for executability." data-ar="أشخاص عندهم مال لكن ليس لديهم أفكار — المنصة تمنحهم فرصة الاستثمار في مشاريع مُفلتَرة بالذكاء الاصطناعي وموثوقة. ليس استثماراً عشوائياً — استثمار في أفكار تم التحقق من قابليتها للتنفيذ.">People with capital but without ideas — the platform gives them the opportunity to invest in AI-filtered, thoroughly assessed ventures. Not random investing — investing in ideas that have been validated for executability.</p>
      <div class="inv-tags">
        <span class="inv-tag" data-en="Pre-filtered ideas only" data-ar="أفكار مُفلتَرة فقط"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px;"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg>Pre-filtered ideas only</span>
        <span class="inv-tag" data-en="Clear equity defined upfront" data-ar="حصة واضحة محددة مسبقاً"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px;"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg>Clear equity defined upfront</span>
        <span class="inv-tag" data-en="Full progress transparency" data-ar="شفافية كاملة في التقدم"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px;"><path d="M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9"></path><path d="M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16"></path><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="1"></circle></svg>Full progress transparency</span>
        <span class="inv-tag" data-en="UrLife guarantees the process" data-ar="UrLife تضمن العملية"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="display:inline;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px;"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg>UrLife guarantees the process</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="inv-stat">
      <div class="inv-val" data-en="Win<br>Win" data-ar="الكل<br>يربح">Win<br>Win</div>
      <div class="inv-label" data-en="Everyone benefits — the idea, the capital, the expertise" data-ar="الكل مستفيد — الفكرة، المال، الخبرة">Everyone benefits — the idea, the capital, the expertise</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="divline"></div>

<!-- ══════════ AI LAYER ══════════ -->
<div class="section reveal">
  <div class="sec-chip" data-en="AI Intelligence" data-ar="الذكاء الاصطناعي">AI Intelligence</div>
  <h2 class="sec-title" data-en="AI Inside UrLife —<br><span class='g'>The Force Multiplier</span>" data-ar="AI داخل UrLife —<br><span class='g'>مُضاعف القوة</span>">AI Inside UrLife —<br><span class="g">The Force Multiplier</span></h2>
  <p class="sec-body" data-en="Not a feature — the core intelligence layer that makes UrLife faster, smarter, and more accurate than any human-only process." data-ar="ليست ميزة — بل طبقة الذكاء الأساسية التي تجعل UrLife أسرع وأذكى وأدق من أي عملية بشرية بحتة.">Not a feature — the core intelligence layer that makes UrLife faster, smarter, and more accurate than any human-only process.</p>

  <div class="ai-panel reveal-scale">
    <div class="ai-head">
      <h3><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 36 36" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px"><defs><radialGradient id="brn-rg" cx="33%" cy="28%" r="72%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f5e0a0"/><stop offset="45%" stop-color="#D4A373"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#5a2a08"/></radialGradient><filter id="brn-f"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="2" stdDeviation="3" flood-color="#D4A373" flood-opacity="0.5"/></filter></defs><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="14" fill="url(#brn-rg)" filter="url(#brn-f)"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="4" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.45)"/><line x1="18" y1="4" x2="18" y2="14" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/><line x1="18" y1="22" x2="18" y2="32" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/><line x1="4" y1="18" x2="14" y2="18" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/><line x1="22" y1="18" x2="32" y2="18" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="4" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/><circle cx="18" cy="32" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/><circle cx="4" cy="18" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/><circle cx="32" cy="18" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/><ellipse cx="13" cy="11" rx="3" ry="1.8" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.15)" transform="rotate(-25 13 11)"/></svg><span data-en="What AI Does Inside UrLife" data-ar="ما يفعله AI داخل UrLife">What AI Does Inside UrLife</span></h3>
      <span class="ai-badge" data-en="PHASE 2 LAUNCH" data-ar="إطلاق المرحلة 2">PHASE 2 LAUNCH</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-features">
      <div class="aif">
        <div class="aif-ico"><svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><linearGradient id="pyr-g1" x1="15%" y1="0%" x2="85%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ff8870"/><stop offset="50%" stop-color="#ef4444"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7a1010"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="pyr-g2" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ff9080"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#c02020"/></linearGradient><filter id="pyr-f"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="3" stdDeviation="3" flood-color="#ef4444" flood-opacity="0.55"/></filter></defs><g filter="url(#pyr-f)"><polygon points="18,4 32,28 18,32 4,28" fill="url(#pyr-g1)"/><polygon points="18,4 32,28 18,32" fill="url(#pyr-g2)" opacity="0.75"/><polygon points="18,4 4,28 18,32" fill="rgba(0,0,0,0.2)"/></g><polygon points="4,28 32,28 18,32" fill="rgba(0,0,0,0.25)"/><ellipse cx="15" cy="12" rx="3" ry="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.25)" transform="rotate(-20 15 12)"/><circle cx="18" cy="8" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.4)"/></svg></div>
        <h4 data-en="Idea Evaluator" data-ar="مُقيّم الأفكار">Idea Evaluator</h4>
        <p data-en="Analyzes any idea and generates a Viability Score with detailed feedback on market, competition, and feasibility." data-ar="يحلل أي فكرة ويولّد Viability Score مع ملاحظات تفصيلية حول السوق والمنافسة والجدوى.">Analyzes any idea and generates a Viability Score with detailed feedback on market, competition, and feasibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="aif">
        <div class="aif-ico"><svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><linearGradient id="gem-g1" x1="20%" y1="0%" x2="80%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f5e0a0"/><stop offset="40%" stop-color="#D4A373"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7a4010"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="gem-g2" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#e8c880"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#5a2800"/></linearGradient><filter id="gem-f"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="3" stdDeviation="3" flood-color="#D4A373" flood-opacity="0.5"/></filter></defs><g filter="url(#gem-f)"><polygon points="18,3 31,14 18,33 5,14" fill="url(#gem-g1)"/><polygon points="18,3 31,14 18,18" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.25)"/><polygon points="5,14 18,14 18,33" fill="rgba(0,0,0,0.2)"/><polygon points="5,14 18,3 18,14" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.1)"/></g><line x1="5" y1="14" x2="31" y2="14" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="0.8"/><ellipse cx="14" cy="9" rx="3.5" ry="2" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.2)" transform="rotate(-30 14 9)"/></svg></div>
        <h4 data-en="Smart Matcher" data-ar="المطابق الذكي">Smart Matcher</h4>
        <p data-en="Matches ideas with people based on skills, ambition level, work style, and complementarity — not just keywords." data-ar="يطابق الأفكار بالأشخاص بناءً على المهارات ومستوى الطموح وأسلوب العمل والتكامل.">Matches ideas with people based on skills, ambition level, work style, and complementarity — not just keywords.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="aif">
        <div class="aif-ico"><svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><linearGradient id="bc-gf" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f0d080"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#c07830"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="bc-gm" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#D4A373"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#a05020"/></linearGradient><filter id="bc-f"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="3" stdDeviation="2.5" flood-color="#D4A373" flood-opacity="0.5"/></filter></defs><g filter="url(#bc-f)"><rect x="3" y="20" width="7" height="12" rx="1.5" fill="url(#bc-gm)"/><ellipse cx="6.5" cy="20" rx="3.5" ry="1.5" fill="#f0d080"/><rect x="14" y="12" width="8" height="20" rx="1.5" fill="url(#bc-gf)"/><ellipse cx="18" cy="12" rx="4" ry="1.5" fill="#f5e0a0"/><rect x="26" y="6" width="7" height="26" rx="1.5" fill="url(#bc-gf)"/><ellipse cx="29.5" cy="6" rx="3.5" ry="1.5" fill="#fffad0"/></g></svg></div>
        <h4 data-en="Market Analyst" data-ar="محلل السوق">Market Analyst</h4>
        <p data-en="Runs automatic market research, identifies the opportunity size, strongest competitors, and go-to-market strategy." data-ar="يُجري أبحاث سوق تلقائية، يحدد حجم الفرصة وأقوى المنافسين واستراتيجية الدخول للسوق.">Runs automatic market research, identifies the opportunity size, strongest competitors, and go-to-market strategy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="aif">
        <div class="aif-ico"><svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><radialGradient id="copi-rg" cx="33%" cy="28%" r="72%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#FFEAB0"/><stop offset="45%" stop-color="#D4AF37"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#6F540D"/></radialGradient><filter id="copi-f"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="3" stdDeviation="3" flood-color="#D4AF37" flood-opacity="0.55"/></filter></defs><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="14" fill="url(#copi-rg)" filter="url(#copi-f)"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="5" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/><line x1="18" y1="4" x2="18" y2="13" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/><line x1="18" y1="23" x2="18" y2="32" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/><line x1="4" y1="18" x2="13" y2="18" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/><line x1="23" y1="18" x2="32" y2="18" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="18" cy="4" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/><circle cx="18" cy="32" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/><circle cx="4" cy="18" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/><circle cx="32" cy="18" r="1.5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.5)"/><ellipse cx="13" cy="11" rx="3" ry="1.8" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.15)" transform="rotate(-25 13 11)"/></svg></div>
        <h4 data-en="Project Co-Pilot" data-ar="مساعد المشروع">Project Co-Pilot</h4>
        <p data-en="An AI assistant for every active project: tracks milestones, suggests next steps, resolves blockers, and keeps the team aligned." data-ar="مساعد AI لكل مشروع نشط: يتابع المعالم، يقترح الخطوات التالية، يحل العقبات، ويحافظ على تناسق الفريق.">An AI assistant for every active project: tracks milestones, suggests next steps, resolves blockers, and keeps the team aligned.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-footer">
      <strong data-en="Important note:" data-ar="ملاحظة مهمة:">Important note:</strong> <span data-en="AI is not required from day one. Start with human curation and simple forms. When the model proves itself at 500+ members, AI becomes true leverage — not premature complexity." data-ar="AI ليس ضرورياً من اليوم الأول. ابدأ بالاختيار البشري والنماذج البسيطة. عندما يثبت النموذج نفسه عند 500+ عضو، يصبح AI رافعة حقيقية — وليس تعقيداً مبكراً.">AI is not required from day one. Start with human curation and simple forms. When the model proves itself at 500+ members, AI becomes true leverage — not premature complexity.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="divline"></div>

<!-- ══════════ ROADMAP ══════════ -->
<div class="section reveal" id="roadmap">
  <div class="sec-chip" data-en="The Journey" data-ar="خارطة الطريق">The Journey</div>
  <h2 class="sec-title" data-en="From Day One<br><span class='g'>to a Global Platform</span>" data-ar="من اليوم الأول<br><span class='g'>إلى منصة عالمية</span>">From Day One<br><span class="g">to a Global Platform</span></h2>

  <div class="roadmap reveal-scale">
    <div class="rm">
      <div class="rm-n">1</div>
      <div class="rm-when" data-en="MONTH 1–2 — SEED" data-ar="الشهر 1–2 — البذرة">MONTH 1–2 — SEED</div>
      <h4 data-en="Prove the Concept" data-ar="إثبات المفهوم">Prove the Concept</h4>
      <p data-en="Simple form + spreadsheet + WhatsApp. First 20 ideas evaluated manually. Prove people are interested and matching works." data-ar="نموذج بسيط + جدول بيانات + واتساب. أول 20 فكرة تُقيَّم يدوياً. إثبات اهتمام الناس وعمل المطابقة.">Simple form + spreadsheet + WhatsApp. First 20 ideas evaluated manually. Prove people are interested and matching works.</p>
      <div class="rm-kpi" data-en="Goal: 20 accepted ideas" data-ar="هدف: 20 فكرة مقبولة">Goal: 20 accepted ideas</div>
    </div>
    <div class="rm">
      <div class="rm-n">2</div>
      <div class="rm-when" data-en="MONTH 3–6 — MVP" data-ar="الشهر 3–6 — MVP">MONTH 3–6 — MVP</div>
      <h4 data-en="Build the Core Platform" data-ar="بناء المنصة الأساسية">Build the Core Platform</h4>
      <p data-en="Webflow site + Airtable database + GPT-4 evaluation + Calendly + Notion for active projects.  from day one." data-ar="موقع Webflow + قاعدة بيانات Airtable + تقييم GPT-4 + Calendly + Notion للمشاريع النشطة. عربي وإنجليزي من اليوم الأول.">Webflow site + Airtable database + GPT-4 evaluation + Calendly + Notion for active projects.  from day one.</p>
      <div class="rm-kpi" data-en="Goal: 200 members + 5 active projects" data-ar="هدف: 200 عضو + 5 مشاريع نشطة">Goal: 200 members + 5 active projects</div>
    </div>
    <div class="rm">
      <div class="rm-n">3</div>
      <div class="rm-when" data-en="MONTH 7–14 — GROWTH" data-ar="الشهر 7–14 — النمو">MONTH 7–14 — GROWTH</div>
      <h4 data-en="Scale the Community" data-ar="توسيع المجتمع">Scale the Community</h4>
      <p data-en="Full platform (Next.js), AI Matching, Enabler Fund, media presence across Arab world and globally. First exit or revenue from a successful project." data-ar="منصة كاملة (Next.js)، مطابقة AI، صندوق الممكّنين، حضور إعلامي عربي وعالمي. أول خروج أو إيراد من مشروع ناجح.">Full platform (Next.js), AI Matching, Enabler Fund, media presence across Arab world and globally. First exit or revenue from a successful project.</p>
      <div class="rm-kpi" data-en="Goal: 2,000+ members + first $100K equity" data-ar="هدف: 2,000+ عضو + أول $100K حصص">Goal: 2,000+ members + first $100K equity</div>
    </div>
    <div class="rm">
      <div class="rm-n">4</div>
      <div class="rm-when" data-en="YEAR 2+ — EMPIRE" data-ar="السنة 2+ — الإمبراطورية">YEAR 2+ — EMPIRE</div>
      <h4 data-en="UrLife Global" data-ar="UrLife عالمي">UrLife Global</h4>
      <p data-en="Corporate partnerships, Annual Summit, official UrLife Fund, expansion to MENA, Europe & beyond. The YCombinator for the Arab world and Emerging Markets." data-ar="شراكات مؤسسية، قمة سنوية، صندوق UrLife الرسمي، التوسع لـ MENA وأوروبا وما بعدها. YCombinator العالم العربي والأسواق الناشئة.">Corporate partnerships, Annual Summit, official UrLife Fund, expansion to MENA, Europe & beyond. The YCombinator for the Arab world and Emerging Markets.</p>
      <div class="rm-kpi" data-en="Goal: 10,000+ members + project portfolio" data-ar="هدف: 10,000+ عضو + محفظة مشاريع">Goal: 10,000+ members + project portfolio</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════ MANIFESTO ══════════ -->
<div class="manifesto reveal">
  <div class="manifesto-watermark">URLIFE</div>
  <blockquote>
    <span data-en='"The difference between an idea that dies<br>and one that <span class="g">builds an empire</span><br>is not money —<br>it is <span class="e">who you meet.</span>"' data-ar='"الفرق بين فكرة تموت<br>وفكرة <span class="g">تبني إمبراطورية</span><br>ليس المال —<br>بل <span class="e">من تلتقي به.</span>"'>"The difference between an idea that dies<br>and one that <span class="g">builds an empire</span><br>is not money —<br>it is <span class="e">who you meet.</span>"</span>
  </blockquote>
  <p class="manifesto-sub" data-en="UrLife is not a product — it's a movement. A movement to transform wasted minds into real ventures that build the future." data-ar="UrLife ليس منتجاً — إنه حركة. حركة لتحويل العقول الضائعة إلى مشاريع حقيقية تبني المستقبل.">UrLife is not a product — it's a movement. A movement to transform wasted minds into real ventures that build the future.</p>
</div>

<!-- ══════════ TECH STACK ══════════ -->
