  <p class="sec-body" data-en="Start with what proves the concept. Add complexity only when the need is proven." data-ar="ابدأ بما يُثبت المفهوم. أضف التعقيد فقط عندما تثبت الحاجة.">Start with what proves the concept. Add complexity only when the need is proven.</p>
